# Module 4 — optional environment configuration
#
# Copy to .env and edit, or just export these in the shell before starting.
# Everything here is optional: every value has a sidebar equivalent, and the
# application starts and runs with none of them set.
#
#     cp .env.example .env

# Folder holding sample data — a checkout of the shared repository, if there is
# one on this machine. It is used only by the sample, checkpoint and video
# pickers; nothing in the inspection path reads from disk. A sibling checkout
# named Image-Processing is found automatically without setting this.
PCB_WORKSPACE=C:\Users\you\Image-Processing

# The two upstream services. These are entered in the sidebar rather than read
# from here — listed so the addresses live somewhere the team can share.
#   Modules 1 & 2 (pre-processing and alignment)  docs/API_CONTRACT_PIPELINE.md
#   PIPELINE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8100
#   Module 3 (defect detection)                   docs/API_CONTRACT.md
#   DETECTOR_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
